/skills/

# ECC ecosystem mirror under gemini-skills/ — a drifted copy of the gitignored
# everything-claude-code/ upstream. The package ports capabilities into the
# Gemini-native surface (skills/ + .gemini/commands/*.toml) via the c54bfac
# convert pattern; it does NOT vendor this raw fork. Keep the working copy local
# but out of git. Tracked c54bfac artifacts (bootstrap.ps1, scripts/lib/
# session-adapters + state-store, the 9 design docs) are deliberately NOT matched.
